  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="acbee192-bc2f-5404-a217-0926b7cb9fd1" activityNameId="a70a7254-b4d7-5030-85d5-18bad8b730c1" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Operation, biogas combustion, in cogen with biogas engine</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Operation, biogas combustion, in cogen with biogas engine
This dataset needs to be combined with the datasets for the biogas input and the infrastrucure expenditures in order to establish the multi-output process which provides the products electricity and heat from cogeneration.;
UUID: 189b2581-b908-3215-b63f-2e1b819af19f
Use of biogas in a cogeneration unit. Included are emissions to air, as well as use and disposal of operational supplements. Excluded are the biogas consumption and infrastructure expenditures.
Location: Conditions of cogeneration in Switzerland.
Technology: Lambda 1-engine" with a catalytic converter
Time period: undefined
Production volume: In 2002 the production of electricity from biogas was 9.8 GWh/a.
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_189b2581-b908-3215-b63f-2e1b819af19f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
